				<r3d:description language="eng">The Australian Institute of Marine Science (AIMS) is a tropical marine research centre. The AIMS Data Repository preserves experimental and survey data, sensor data, research analyses and other types of data collected by projects conducted by the Australian Institute of Marine Science (AIMS). Contributors to the repository are primarily AIMS researchers from various science disciplines including ecology, biology, environmental sciences, microbiology, geosciences and oceanography, geochemistry, biodiversity conservation, evolutionary environmental studies, climate and oceanic change, fisheries, biochemistry and molecular biology, limnology and functions of inland waters, genetics and hereditary, observing network</r3d:description>
